{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:jash:impact:v1",
  "title": "Observed retained test correlations and explicit optional executions",
  "description": "Queries return one analysis record; --run returns the analysis, up to three checked execution receipts, then a summary (JSONL/JTV2). Uses actual registered test-command classifier and correlation weights on strictly read retained sessions and fsjournal. Runs sorted by timestamp/source order. A failed test stops further execution and is a fully observed COMPLETE outcome; source/capture failures are FAILED. The correlation is not causality or a dependency proof; legacy recorded commands may be incomplete and selected commands over511bytes are refused before execution.",
